{"reviewId": "354410388_83E8Q9vYG", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 7, "content": "在选择赛道时，可以多问自己一句：这个行业，是否服务于“经营好一座现代城市”这个宏大目标？ 如果是，那它就很可能处于未来的黄金赛道上。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "我们现在谈论城市化，实际上与我们未来的产业选择有极大的关联性。因为我们把城市化作为本次经济起飞的原动力，所以，未来产业多样化过程中的主导产业将会沿着城市化的线索展开，对这一点，国际经验早有证明。", "range": "7701-7798", "chapterName": "02 繁荣的起点 工业化转型期的投资全景", "chapterIdx": 7, "reviewId": "354410388_83E8Q9vYG", "userVid": 354410388, "topics": [], "createTime": 1759565798, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "02 繁荣的起点 工业化转型期的投资全景", "author": {"userVid": 354410388, "name": "清愚", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0003-Q9eDh1j0JzhIOSxGJ9vke10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "清愚", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "世事无常，但求心安", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-1000", "desc": "阅读时长", "title": "阅读时长", "levelIndex": 1000}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 21, "likes": [{"userVid": 3130868, "name": "隔川", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/v6XbW38nFOQXvmR7akk3GKZicpWdSCqPXjYwSaiaPD4Ofibicfk2Lnicdz7ia2OllLqwHpFaibjESymE18/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "隔川", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "对一切看似知道实则不知道的事情充满好奇", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-500", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 500}}], "commentsCount": 3, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "这已经是20年前的经验了", "reviewId": "354410388_83E8Q9vYG", "commentId": "354410388_83E8Q9vYG_c307096000_84JcEdj